    <h2>What Are DQ Cheese Curds?</h2>
  <p>Authentic Wisconsin cheese curds start with fresh, squeaky white cheddar morsels that are lightly dredged in seasoned breading and flash-fried to order. This quick fry seals the moisture inside, producing a crackly outer shell that houses gooey, molten cheese. Because they are prepared fresh, every basket arrives steaming hot with maximum cheese pull. Explore our entire range of appetizers and sides on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Best DQ Snack for Sharing</h2>
  <p>With an ample portion priced at just $3.99, Cheese Curds offer exceptional value for pairs or groups seeking a shared appetizer. While delicious completely plain, they become legendary when dipped into chilled ranch or DQ's signature Country Gravy—the very same peppered white sauce made famous by our <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Baskets</a>.</p>
